{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend Eli is convinced his family is being haunted.\u00a0At first you don't believe him. But then he shows you the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eli's parents dismiss it as an overactive imagination. He needs clearer evidence. As a budding photo editor, that's where you come in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Walls Have Eyes... and Faces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.poster.avif?t=1757323322\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.webm?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.mp4?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the latest\u00a0<i>SpectralAware\u2122 2.1</i>\u00a0software to analyze Eli's family photos and home videos. Adjust the exposure, contrast and noise, and apply different filters to reveal the horrors hiding in plain sight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Have Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.poster.avif?t=1757323322\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.webm?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.mp4?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a detailed manual, sort your findings into different categories - Apparitions, Simulacra, Strange Lights, Demonic Entities, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's vital you get it right, as mistakes carry consequences - the fate of Eli and his family rests on your answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hereditary Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.poster.avif?t=1757323322\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.webm?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.mp4?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the family's history - and, if you're observant - the true reason behind the hauntings, inherited and handed down from generation to generation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between photo investigations, explore the house in tense first-person sections where the consequences of your actions bleed  into the present-day.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.poster.avif?t=1757323322\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.webm?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.mp4?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Slow-Burn Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Her Story</i>, <i>Mouthwashing, Home Safety Hotline</i>, and Kiyoshi Kurosawa's masterpiece horror film <i>Pulse</i> (2001), <strong>this is true psychological horror that lingers <i>long after</i>\u00a0you've logged off. You may feel you're being watched in your own home. Are you up for it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-game computer with\u00a0<i>SpectralAware\u2122 2.1 </i>- a photo and video analysis tool for detecting the paranormal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ haunting photos and video clips that dig through a hidden, multi-generational narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person sections in the house where the present-day  horror turns to immediate terror around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp, gripping and cathartic storytelling from Frostwood Interactive (<i>Rainswept</i>, <i>Unwording</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An early-2000s style OS with Frutiger Aero aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798860?t=1757323322","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/857fae1bf2c4624b0c814dba04f0c4293b928746/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757323322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/dbfbed48c059bf9d5aa9ac00436dfcd6e69d91b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757323322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/dbfbed48c059bf9d5aa9ac00436dfcd6e69d91b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757323322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains topics and imagery that some players may find disturbing such as gore, bodily mutilations, depictions of ghosts, and references to suicide."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your best friend Eli is convinced his family is being haunted.\u00a0At first you don't believe him. But then he shows you the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eli's parents dismiss it as an overactive imagination. He needs clearer evidence. As a budding photo editor, that's where you come in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Walls Have Eyes... and Faces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.poster.avif?t=1757323322\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.webm?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/4de8b78fcbbf36cc5088005dc464b689.mp4?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the latest\u00a0<i>SpectralAware\u2122 2.1</i>\u00a0software to analyze Eli's family photos and home videos. Adjust the exposure, contrast and noise, and apply different filters to reveal the horrors hiding in plain sight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Have Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.poster.avif?t=1757323322\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.webm?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/050bb148bb483321c668e13b48ed322e.mp4?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a detailed manual, sort your findings into different categories - Apparitions, Simulacra, Strange Lights, Demonic Entities, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's vital you get it right, as mistakes carry consequences - the fate of Eli and his family rests on your answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hereditary Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.poster.avif?t=1757323322\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.webm?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/1b8269b7c816150946810e958856c540.mp4?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the family's history - and, if you're observant - the true reason behind the hauntings, inherited and handed down from generation to generation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between photo investigations, explore the house in tense first-person sections where the consequences of your actions bleed  into the present-day.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.poster.avif?t=1757323322\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.webm?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/extras/ff8f686f46520c1998317f84c77eab4f.mp4?t=1757323322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Slow-Burn Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Her Story</i>, <i>Mouthwashing, Home Safety Hotline</i>, and Kiyoshi Kurosawa's masterpiece horror film <i>Pulse</i> (2001), <strong>this is true psychological horror that lingers <i>long after</i>\u00a0you've logged off. You may feel you're being watched in your own home. Are you up for it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-game computer with\u00a0<i>SpectralAware\u2122 2.1 </i>- a photo and video analysis tool for detecting the paranormal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ haunting photos and video clips that dig through a hidden, multi-generational narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person sections in the house where the present-day  horror turns to immediate terror around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp, gripping and cathartic storytelling from Frostwood Interactive (<i>Rainswept</i>, <i>Unwording</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An early-2000s style OS with Frutiger Aero aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","developers":["Frostwood Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798860/7a7d17843bd2eee7e4316a231462fac9df8eea7f/header.jpg?t=1757323322","is_free":false,"